# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only, P1-scoped ignores. The Dev8 root .gitignore also excludes these,
# but a repo should be safe to extract on its own, so the rules are repeated here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and local configuration. NEVER commit a real key or an authenticated
# RPC URL. `.env.example` below is the only env file that is tracked, and it
# contains placeholders only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Keys that are not caught by the `.env*` patterns above
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json
wallet.json

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local caches / logs / editor state
.cache/
coverage/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Harness scratch: the Loops evaluator prompt is large and regenerable with
# `loops evaluate --event road-to-devcon-vii --problem portable-ai-preferences`.
.harness/